# ∅FREQ environment
# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in. Restart `npm run dev` after changes.
# On Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables, same names.

# ─── ElevenLabs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Server only, never sent to the browser. Powers the System voice and the sound layer.
# 1. Sign up at https://elevenlabs.io
# 2. Hackathon credits: Discord https://discord.com/invite/VnBvbbcdEC → #coupon-codes
#    → Start Redemption → pick U-Hackathon, use your registration email (1 month Creator).
#    The free tier also works for a demo, with fewer credits.
# 3. https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys → Create API Key
#    Permissions needed: Text to Speech, Sound Effects.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# Optional. Voice for the System. Empty = premade multilingual voice "George".
# Voice Library → pick a voice → copy its Voice ID.
ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=

# ─── Avalanche Fuji (C-Chain testnet, chainId 43113) ─────────────────────────
# Not a secret: the address of your deployed ZeroFreq contract.
# 1. Install a wallet: Core (https://core.app) or MetaMask.
# 2. Get test AVAX: Avalanche Builder Hub faucet https://build.avax.network/console/primary-network/faucet
# 3. Run the app, open http://localhost:3000/deploy, press DEPLOY CONTRACT, confirm in the wallet.
# 4. Paste the address shown here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FREQ_CONTRACT=
